          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5 Styling Tools In 1",
            "content": "<p>Replace your dryer, curler, straightener and brushes with one versatile styling system. Create curls, smooth styles, volume and effortless blowouts using five interchangeable attachments.</p>"
          }
        },
        "row_WQkP4q": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Advanced Airflow Styling",
            "content": "<p>High-velocity airflow shapes hair while it dries, helping create salon-inspired styles without relying on extreme heat from traditional styling tools.</p>"
          }
        },
        "row_XLJKGz": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Lower Heat, Gentle Styling",
            "content": "<p>With three controlled heat settings (55°C, 80°C and 105°C), Curlear lets you choose the right temperature for your hair type while maintaining styling performance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "row_7LyKer": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Customised Results For Every Hair Type",
            "content": "<p>Choose from multiple heat, speed and attachment options to create your preferred look — from smooth straight styles to bouncy curls and added volume.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
